OL,3,GNEWSAShetland hit by flooding and
OL,4,Alandslide after 'biblical' rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FShetland has been hit by flash flooding
OL,7,Fand a landslide after heavy rain hit
OL,8,Fthe island ahead of a weekend of
OL,9,Fforecast extreme weather.
OL,11,FThe road between Garderhouse and
OL,12,FReawick in the west of mainland of the
OL,13,Fisland has been closed due to a
OL,14,Flandslide that has blocked the road.
OL,16,FSeveral cafes, restaurants and shops
OL,17,Faround in Lerwick were also hit by
OL,18,Fflash flooding
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
