OL,3,GNEWSAShetland hit by flooding and
OL,4,Alandslide after 'biblical' rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes ahead of yellow rain warnings
OL,7,Fcoming into force for parts of Scotland
OL,8,Fon Friday morning as Storm Austen moves
OL,9,Fin, the first of two named storms that
OL,10,Fwill cross the country in the coming
OL,11,Fdays.
